{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"bbec1528c4afb01c256429d2913eafcf1504705762d116562c9fe92a9045c061"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:4f21108c8588356e3564f82190af443d1e9ff703a73421bce508650dc8a8fb66","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"August 2023","evidence":"[D4:8 | 4:17 pm on 2 August, 2023] John: Oh yeah, I remember you telling me about Harry Potter! I've got a funny story. Anthony and I went to this charity thing and ended up in this intense Harry Potter trivia contest. We did alright, but there was this one super-nerd there that took home this as a prize.\n\n[D22:2 | 7:42 pm on 8 December, 2023] John: Hey Tim! Sounds awesome! So glad you had a blast at the Harry Potter party. Last August I told you about my fun time at a charity event with Harry Potter trivia. Love being with people who are as passionate about Harry Potter as us! Did you dress up as any character?","itemId":"urn:uuid:082e4eb0-735e-56a6-ad9a-51bfa44fddfc","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:cb9c0813fc456ca69b521fcc6fecde54a0cd6078a01c8783206e51f276ca6513","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did John attend the Harry Potter trivia?","referenceAnswer":"August 2023.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"cb9c0813fc456ca69b521fcc6fecde54a0cd6078a01c8783206e51f276ca6513"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}